@startuml agent_capabilities
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

package "Agent Capability Comparison" {
  
  package "Red Agent Action Space |A^(r)| = 295" {
    rectangle "**Phase 1: Discovery**\n\nNetwork Scan\nService Enumeration" as Phase1 #FFE6E6
    rectangle "**Phase 2: Initial Access**\n\nExploit Vulnerability\nCredential Access" as Phase2 #FFE6E6  
    rectangle "**Phase 3: Lateral Movement**\n\nRemote Access\nPrivilege Escalation" as Phase3 #FFE6E6
    rectangle "**Phase 4: Impact**\n\nData Exfiltration\nSystem Disruption" as Phase4 #FFE6E6
  }
  
  package "Blue Agent Action Space |A^(b)| = 2|H| + 1" {
    rectangle "**Deploy Decoy**\n\nSelect Host h ∈ H\nCreate Deception" as Deploy #E6F3FF
    rectangle "**Remove Decoy**\n\nTarget Host h ∈ H\nCleanup Resources" as Remove #E6F3FF
    rectangle "**No Operation**\n\nMaintain State\nObserve Network" as Nothing #E6F3FF
  }
}

Phase1 --> Phase2 : MITRE\nATT&CK
Phase2 --> Phase3 : Kill Chain
Phase3 --> Phase4 : Progression

Deploy <--> Remove : Strategic\nDecision
Remove <--> Nothing : Making
Nothing <--> Deploy : Process

note bottom : Asymmetric action spaces balanced through reward design

@enduml
